of the median plane of the tongue, though not quite reaching the dorsum. It is thicker behind than in front, and occasionally contains a small fibrocartilage, about 6 mm. in length. It is well displayed by making a vertical section across the organ.\")\n","metadata":{"matches":15,"truncated":false},"title":"fibrocartilage","time":{"start":1778554966023,"end":1778554966040}},"id":"prt_e1a230e2e001Qa6hwtKxPZ3ATi","sessionID":"ses_1e5eb75c1ffeSiHOAuGDRfhx55","messageID":"msg_e1a226f980017oeNPKSaPZNyRB"}}
