p://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"OMA:P11087\") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"PRO:DNx\") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_P11087> \"A collagen alpha-1(I) chain that is encoded in the genome of mouse.\")\n\n  Line 154610: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_P11087> \"collagen alpha-1(I) chain (mouse)\")\n","metadata":{"matches":11,"truncated":false},"title":"collagen alpha-1\\(I\\) chain","time":{"start":1778554972040,"end":1778554972056}},"id":"prt_e1a23103e001M6IJd1jAd9q5e7","sessionID":"ses_1e5eb75c1ffeSiHOAuGDRfhx55","messageID":"msg_e1a226f980017oeNPKSaPZNyRB"}}
